  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am May. I draw people. Look at my pictures. This is a face. It has two eyes. It has two ears. It is a happy face.",
      "This is my brother. His name is Pat. He is five. He is young. He has a big smile. \"Is it Pat?\" asks Mom. \"Yes, it is!\" Pat likes it. Mom likes it too.",
      "This is my grandma. She is old. Her hair is gray. She has a nice face. How many people? Three people! I like my pictures."
    ],
    "summary": "May draws pictures of people. She shows a face with eyes and ears, her young brother Pat, and her old grandma.",
